    <skos:altLabel>Head of Sales</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Person role that configures pipelines and territories, reviews forecasts, and approves discounts and closes. Bearer: person. Permissions: Pipeline:read, Pipeline:write, Territory:read, Territory:write, Forecast:read, Forecast:write, Opportunity:read, Quote:read, Account:read.</skos:definition>
